<p>This policy describes how the Rybička zlatá website processes personal data. You can contact the operator at
  <%= mail_to 'porybny@rybickazlata.cz' %> or through the <%= link_to 'contact form', about_path %>.</p>

<h2>Data we process and why</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Your account and use of the website.</strong> We use your name, email address and account preferences
    to create and manage your account. We also process information you enter, such as wishes, comments and contacts,
    to provide the service. Who can see a wish depends on its visibility settings.</li>
  <li><strong>Facebook Login and other sign-in providers.</strong> If you choose this option, we receive an account
    identifier from the provider. Depending on what is available, we also receive your name, email address, language
    or time zone. We use these details to sign you in, create or link your account, and set up your profile.
    The provider handles authentication under its own policies.</li>
  <li><strong>Support and security.</strong> We use your messages and contact details to respond to enquiries.
    We use technical data such as IP addresses and request logs to run, troubleshoot and protect the service.</li>
</ul>
<p>We process data needed to provide the service to perform our contract with you. We have a legitimate interest
  in keeping the service secure and responding to general enquiries. We also process data when required by law.</p>

<h2>Cookies and other services</h2>
<p>We use cookies to keep you signed in, remember your language and appearance preferences, and protect forms.
  Hosting and email providers may process data when you use the website. The website also loads fonts from Google
  Fonts and includes an embedded YouTube video on the home page. Loading these services sends technical information,
  such as your IP address, to their operators.</p>

<h2>Retention and deletion requests</h2>
<p>We retain data needed for your account while you use it. We keep other data for as long as needed to handle
  requests, protect the service, meet legal obligations or defend legal claims.</p>
<p id="data-deletion">You can close your account in your account settings. To request deletion of personal data,
  including data received through Facebook Login, use the <%= link_to 'contact form', about_path %> or email
  <%= mail_to 'porybny@rybickazlata.cz' %>. Include the email address associated with your account and describe
  the data your request concerns. We may verify your identity before processing the request.</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You may request access, correction, deletion, restriction of processing or portability of your personal data.
  You may also object to processing based on legitimate interests and file a complaint with the
  <%= link_to 'Czech Office for Personal Data Protection', 'https://uoou.gov.cz/' %>.</p>
